    {
      "id": "quote-4",
      "type": "quote",
      "content": {
        "quote": "\"There is an urgent need for accountability and transformation within the fossil fuel industry to avoid the worst effects of climate breakdown - sponsoring major sporting events to greenwash their dirty business has to be stopped. In this film, we wanted to make visible the tremendous scale of our global crude oil production, and expose the extreme rate at which we are continuing to fuel our climate crisis. Together, let us stand against the exploitation of sports for corporate interests and advocate for a sustainable, livable future for all.\"",
        "cite": "Directors Jorik Dozy & Sil van der Woerd"
      },
      "padBottom": "4-5"
    },
    {
      "id": "campaign-5",
      "type": "campaign",
      "content": {
        "heading": "The Campaign",
        "text": "A full 360 campaign was created in collaboration with UK based production company Park Village and agency 20 Something. The campaign performed so well in the first 24 hours the client extended media to 5 new markets. The film was seen over 40 million times in the first month alone. Meanwhile, the broader campaign reached over 193 million people, receiving coverage from over 200 media outlets. What's more, post-campaign research revealed the work to be some of the strongest ever measured, in all major markets.",
