      "content": {
        "heading": "New York & London",
        "body": "To amplify the release of the film, a striking 3D billboard at prime locations Times Square in New York, and Piccadilly Circus in London was created in collaboration with 20 Something. The screens were turned into swimming pools, bringing the alarming fact into the real world.\n\n‍\n\n**The billboards were launched during New York Fashion Week, making a bold statement to the fasion industry.**"
